        "dw-fatos-avaliacao-elegibilidade": {
          "title" : "Avaliação de elegibilidade",
          "content": "# 1. Dados\n\nEsta estratégia de negócio refere-se aos registros de [Avaliações de Elegibilidade]({% url dicionario-fae %}) e está centrada na **tb&amp;#92;_fat&amp;#92;_avaliacao&amp;#92;_elegibilidade**.\n\n# 2. Estrutura\n\n| Colunas DW | Referência LEDI | Referência sistema |\n| ---------- | --------------- | ------------------ |\n| st&amp;#92;_condic&amp;#92;_acamado  st&amp;#92;_condic&amp;#92;_domiciliado  st&amp;#92;_condic&amp;#92;_ulceras&amp;#92;_feridas  st&amp;#92;_condic&amp;#92;_acompanham&amp;#92;_nutricion  st&amp;#92;_condic&amp;#92;_uso&amp;#92;_sonda&amp;#92;_nasogastri  st&amp;#92;_condic&amp;#92;_uso&amp;#92;_sonda&amp;#92;_nasoentera  st&amp;#92;_condic&amp;#92;_uso&amp;#92;_gastrostomia  st&amp;#92;_condic&amp;#92;_uso&amp;#92;_colostomia  st&amp;#92;_condic&amp;#92;_uso&amp;#92;_cistostomia  st&amp;#92;_condic&amp;#92;_uso&amp;#92;_sond&amp;#92;_vesic&amp;#92;_demor  st&amp;#92;_condic&amp;#92;_acomp&amp;#92;_pre&amp;#92;_operatorio  st&amp;#92;_condic&amp;#92;_acomp&amp;#92;_pos&amp;#92;_operatorio  st&amp;#92;_condic&amp;#92;_adapt&amp;#92;_uso&amp;#92;_ortes&amp;#92;_prot  st&amp;#92;_condic&amp;#92;_reabilita&amp;#92;_domiciliar  st&amp;#92;_condic&amp;#92;_cuidd&amp;#92;_paliat&amp;#92;_oncolog  st&amp;#92;_condic&amp;#92;_cuidd&amp;#92;_paliat&amp;#92;_n&amp;#92;_oncol  st&amp;#92;_condic&amp;#92;_oxigenoterapia&amp;#92;_domic  st&amp;#92;_condic&amp;#92;_uso&amp;#92;_traqueostomia  st&amp;#92;_condic&amp;#92;_uso&amp;#92;_aspir&amp;#92;_via&amp;#92;_aerea  st&amp;#92;_condic&amp;#92;_suport&amp;#92;_ventil&amp;#92;_cpap  st&amp;#92;_condic&amp;#92;_suport&amp;#92;_ventil&amp;#92;_bipap  st&amp;#92;_condic&amp;#92;_dialise&amp;#92;_peritonial  st&amp;#92;_condic&amp;#92;_paracentese  st&amp;#92;_condic&amp;#92;_medicacao&amp;#92;_parenteral | [#18 condicoesAvaliadas]({% url dicionario-fae %}#18-condicoesavaliadas) | Condição(ões) avaliada(s) |\n| st&amp;#92;_inelegivel&amp;#92;_instabil&amp;#92;_clinica  st&amp;#92;_inelegivel&amp;#92;_necessid&amp;#92;_propede  st&amp;#92;_inelegivel&amp;#92;_outro&amp;#92;_motivo&amp;#92;_cli  st&amp;#92;_inelegivel&amp;#92;_ausencia&amp;#92;_cuidad  st&amp;#92;_inelegivel&amp;#92;_outra&amp;#92;_condi&amp;#92;_soci | [#23 conclusaoDestinoInelegivel]({% url dicionario-fae %}#23-conclusaodestinoinelegivel) | Inelegível |\n*Tabela 1. Apresentação das colunas x campos múltipla escolha*\n\nO registro de avaliação de elegibilidade possui os seguintes campos criptografados:\n\n- no&amp;#92;_bairro&amp;#92;_residencia\n- no&amp;#92;_complemento&amp;#92;_residencia\n- no&amp;#92;_email\n- no&amp;#92;_logradouro&amp;#92;_residencia\n- no&amp;#92;_nome\n- no&amp;#92;_nome&amp;#92;_mae\n- no&amp;#92;_nome&amp;#92;_pai\n- no&amp;#92;_nome&amp;#92;_social\n- no&amp;#92;_referencia&amp;#92;_residencia\n- nu&amp;#92;_cep&amp;#92;_residencia\n- nu&amp;#92;_nis\n- nu&amp;#92;_num&amp;#92;_logradouro&amp;#92;_residencia\n- nu&amp;#92;_portaria&amp;#92;_naturalizacao\n- nu&amp;#92;_telefone&amp;#92;_contato\n- nu&amp;#92;_telefone&amp;#92;_residencia",
          "url": "/v736/dw/fatos/avaliacao_elegibilidade.html"
        }
        
